{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11195","headline":"进艇 · 杜甫","name":"进艇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南京久客耕南亩，北望伤神坐北窗。\n昼引老妻乘小艇，晴看稚子浴清江。\n俱飞蛱蝶元相逐，并蔕芙蓉本自双。\n茗饮蔗浆携所有，瓷甖无谢玉爲缸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}